    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In today's climate of instantaneous information transfer, ensuring the credibility of the media is critical. An independent, socially responsible media sector can contribute to the healthy, balanced development of society and strengthening of corporate governance mechanisms. Whereas a weak media sector can reinforce social and economic inequity, impede development and fuel conflicts.",
